#: forum/templates/forum/home_intl.html:35
#: forum/templates/forum/home_intl.html:439
msgid "Bir analizin maliyeti nedir?"
msgstr "Was kostet eine Analyse?"

#: forum/templates/forum/home_intl.html:38
#: forum/templates/forum/home_intl.html:444
